      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Migraine is a syndrome characterized by recurrent headaches with or without aura. Triggers include foods, hormonal changes, and stressors. Migraine must be differentiated from other unilateral headache disorders and from headaches due to other neurologic and systemic diseases."},
